<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen lists 87 new counters this year.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen lists 87 new counters this year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shenzhen has 248 listed firms, 87 of which were floated this year, the official Shenzhen-based Securities Times said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said 21 new issues had been listed this month, with four making their debuts on the exchange's A share market today.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the city's A and B stock markets have helped 71 companies raise a total of 10.7 billion yuan this year.</p>
